                        Args:                                                   
                            model_paths: list of                                
                    filesystem paths to saved PyTorch                           
                    model .pt files.                                            
                            image_paths: list of image                          
                    file paths.                                                 
                            transform: torchvision                              
                    transform to apply.                                         
                            device: torch.device to run                         
